/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * A real Frontier journal `Loadout` event for a Cobra Mk V gunship (39 `Modules`): two medium and
 * one small gimballed beam laser, two multi-cannons and a Bi-Weave generator.
 *
 * Contributed 2026-08-08 UTC by the repository owner from their own fleet, with no upstream
 * project. Stored SHA-256 `8b0a632ad05eb312dee94161aa7205ca4f2ee7dfea0c297d6614051977d95bbe`. It
 * reached this repository as pasted text and is stored re-indented and otherwise unaltered, so the
 * checksum attests to the stored file rather than to a file Frontier wrote.
 *
 * Its `MediumHardpoint3` reports `Quality` 0.9844 on a blueprint the contributor confirms is fully
 * engineered; the capture stays verbatim and `build-metrics.jsonc` records the journal number
 * beside the corrected quality of 1.
 *
 * `ShipName`, `ShipIdent`, `ShipID` and `timestamp` are kept — they describe a ship, and nothing
 * in the event names a person. The engineer names are the game's own NPCs.
 *
 * The capture is Elite Dangerous game output and remains the property of Frontier Developments
 * plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage terms; see ATTRIBUTIONS.md.
 *
 * A stored checksum here is of the payload alone, taken with this header comment removed; a source
 * checksum is of the upstream file as it was received.
 */
